{
  "an5.79:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 5.79 ",
  "an5.79:0.2": "8. Warriors ",
  "an5.79:0.3": "Future Perils (3rd) ",
  "an5.79:1.1": "“Mendicants, these five future perils have not currently arisen, but they will arise in the future. ",
  "an5.79:1.2": "You should look out for them ",
  "an5.79:1.3": "and try to give them up. ",
  "an5.79:2.1": "What five? ",
  "an5.79:2.2": "In a future time there will be mendicants who have not developed their physical endurance, ethics, mind, and wisdom. ",
  "an5.79:2.3": "They will ordain others, ",
  "an5.79:2.4": "but be unable to guide them in the higher ethics, mind, and wisdom. ",
  "an5.79:2.5": "They too will not develop their physical endurance, ethics, mind, and wisdom. ",
  "an5.79:2.6": "They too will ordain others, ",
  "an5.79:2.7": "but be unable to guide them in the higher ethics, mind, and wisdom. ",
  "an5.79:2.8": "They too will not develop their physical endurance, ethics, mind, and wisdom. ",
  "an5.79:2.9": "And that is how corrupt training comes from corrupt teachings, ",
  "an5.79:2.10": "and corrupt teachings come from corrupt training. ",
  "an5.79:2.11": "This is the first future peril that has not currently arisen, but will arise in the future … ",
  "an5.79:2.12": "",
  "an5.79:2.13": "",
  "an5.79:3.1": "Furthermore, in a future time there will be mendicants who have not developed their physical endurance, ethics, mind, and wisdom. ",
  "an5.79:3.2": "They will give dependence to others, ",
